♪ Yet never shared with you ♪

04:37.330 --> 04:39.600
They are taking turns
to attack you and wear you out!

04:39.600 --> 04:40.930
Over there! There he is!

07:22.090 --> 07:23.430
Shrimpie,

07:24.800 --> 07:26.770
why are you here?

09:15.460 --> 09:22.020
[Archives: The Nanyang Mystery]

09:22.320 --> 09:25.050
[Episode 10]

10:35.530 --> 10:36.360
Zhang Hailou,

10:36.840 --> 10:38.300
you didn't disappoint me.

11:17.540 --> 11:18.540
It's all over now.

11:22.740 --> 11:24.310
What on earth happened here?

11:24.310 --> 11:25.840
Who wants to kill you?

11:25.940 --> 11:27.370
These men are clearly more

11:27.370 --> 11:28.620
than just robbers.

11:28.820 --> 11:29.860
Our deal

11:30.250 --> 11:32.380
doesn't oblige me to explain it to you.

11:32.710 --> 11:34.840
Keep doing what you're supposed to do.

11:37.120 --> 11:38.400
Who's this lady?

11:39.010 --> 11:40.960
She's more terrifying than a monster.

11:40.960 --> 11:43.870
Does someone like her
really need our protection?

11:43.980 --> 11:45.390
It only means

11:45.410 --> 11:46.720
that her enemies are more formidable
than we think.

11:46.720 --> 11:47.770
Tally up our losses.

11:47.770 --> 11:49.000
Next, we must take control.

11:49.000 --> 11:51.240
Otherwise, the deal is pointless.

11:51.600 --> 11:52.120
Do it.

11:52.510 --> 11:52.970
Come on.

12:16.120 --> 12:22.800
[The Nan'an]

12:26.690 --> 12:31.690
[A few days later]

13:21.240 --> 13:23.500
Those assassins have all been locked up.

13:23.940 --> 13:25.080
As for your friend's corpse,

13:25.080 --> 13:27.280
Miss Dong said she would take care of it.

13:27.790 --> 13:28.810
So don't worry.

13:50.860 --> 13:52.660
They thought you were Steven,

13:53.360 --> 13:55.290
so they gave you the best medicine.

13:55.890 --> 13:57.790
I didn't expect you to be so fit

13:59.080 --> 14:00.410
and recover so quickly.

14:32.570 --> 14:34.500
You should at least eat something.

14:46.250 --> 14:47.980
Actually, I still don't get it.

14:50.200 --> 14:51.550
I mean, I am a stowaway.

14:53.310 --> 14:55.510
And we caused such a huge mess together.

14:56.970 --> 14:58.650
Why did she let us stay

15:00.390 --> 15:02.720
in such a nice suite
instead of killing us?

15:06.550 --> 15:07.220
Plague,

15:08.500 --> 15:09.410
actually...

15:10.910 --> 15:13.170
Actually, I can understand how you feel.

15:16.870 --> 15:18.400
Before getting on the ship,

15:20.270 --> 15:21.820
my boss committed suicide
right in front of me

15:21.820 --> 15:23.880
because of the alcohol prohibition.

15:24.580 --> 15:27.510
I will never forget that scene
for the rest of my life.

15:28.670 --> 15:29.870
I had no other choice.

15:31.820 --> 15:32.630
With nowhere else to go,

15:32.630 --> 15:34.960
I had to head for Jinfan
to find my brother.

15:36.740 --> 15:38.080
What else could we do?

15:39.600 --> 15:43.600
There are many things you can't hide from,
no matter how much you want to.

15:45.340 --> 15:47.540
But those left behind must keep living.

15:48.510 --> 15:50.460
We have to live well.

15:51.740 --> 15:53.540
And it's not just for ourselves.

15:56.030 --> 15:57.030
Don't you

15:57.770 --> 15:59.620
have anyone you care about?

17:12.349 --> 17:12.980
Mentor,

17:13.810 --> 17:15.010
what are you drawing?

17:20.500 --> 17:22.069
Your true nature is a snake.

17:22.250 --> 17:22.980
A snake

17:23.300 --> 17:24.700
will devour everything.

17:27.119 --> 17:29.120
You must overcome your true nature.

17:32.140 --> 17:34.200
Do you still remember what I told you?

17:34.810 --> 17:35.470
I remember.

17:35.480 --> 17:36.140
Can you do it?

17:36.140 --> 17:36.740
I can.

17:36.740 --> 17:39.530
There's a big difference
between hearing it and doing it.

17:39.530 --> 17:41.420
When you finally manage to do it,

17:41.830 --> 17:43.490
that's when you pay the price.

17:44.050 --> 17:46.000
Only then will you know what I mean.

17:47.330 --> 17:48.950
But you are lucky,

17:49.310 --> 17:51.170
having Zhang Haixia by your side—

17:51.610 --> 17:52.880
he will remind you.

17:53.550 --> 17:54.550
Did you hear that?

17:55.160 --> 17:56.010
Be nice to me.

18:06.610 --> 18:08.270
Put this on when I'm not around

18:09.570 --> 18:10.480
in the future.

18:10.940 --> 18:12.670
Look at it before every action.

19:08.590 --> 19:09.310
Plague.

19:11.810 --> 19:12.460
Plague?

19:16.030 --> 19:17.070
I'll just take a break.

19:17.070 --> 19:18.530
You go ahead and count.

19:19.680 --> 19:21.810
We have to count them all today anyway.

19:24.550 --> 19:25.660
Bro, who are you?

19:26.220 --> 19:27.330
You can't come in here.

19:27.330 --> 19:29.530
Where are the robbers
who were on the ship earlier?

19:29.530 --> 19:30.870
Hey, who are you?

19:34.920 --> 19:36.630
They're mostly all dead.

19:36.830 --> 19:38.360
Only a few of them are alive,

19:38.720 --> 19:40.500
and they've been
locked up by Miss Dong.

19:40.500 --> 19:41.530
After the ship docks,

19:41.530 --> 19:43.000
t-they will be handed over to the police.

19:43.000 --> 19:44.400
Where are they locked up?

20:01.530 --> 20:02.760
Why are you so late?

20:02.920 --> 20:06.260
And what the hell happened
to the bodies in those boxes?

20:06.610 --> 20:08.260
It takes like forever.

20:08.700 --> 20:11.030
I don't know where these bodies came from.

20:11.180 --> 20:13.410
They've all been specially embalmed.

20:13.830 --> 20:15.220
God knows what these Easterners

20:15.220 --> 20:16.570
planned to do with them.

20:16.720 --> 20:18.150
Well, see you later.

20:50.740 --> 20:53.310
You don't need to ask me
any more questions.

20:54.960 --> 20:57.200
I don't know anything,

20:58.810 --> 21:01.200
and I won't say anything.

21:01.960 --> 21:03.470
How did Zhang Haixia die?

21:30.010 --> 21:31.500
Zhang Haixia!

21:31.660 --> 21:33.620
How did he die?

21:54.640 --> 21:55.710
Wait.

22:01.480 --> 22:02.440
Which one

22:02.960 --> 22:05.160
exactly are you asking about?

22:14.160 --> 22:15.640
Zhang Haixia,

22:16.700 --> 22:17.900
who is in his twenties

22:18.880 --> 22:20.720
and paralyzed in both legs.

22:33.250 --> 22:34.440
I know him.

22:35.640 --> 22:36.930
He was very smart

22:37.850 --> 22:39.240
and very formidable.

22:40.570 --> 22:42.110
I hunted him down twice

22:43.180 --> 22:44.780
before I finally killed him.

22:47.310 --> 22:48.510
Tell me more details.

22:49.400 --> 22:50.840
The first time was

22:52.110 --> 22:54.240
when we killed Zhang Ruipu.

22:55.460 --> 22:56.830
Back then, you

22:57.920 --> 23:00.310
had a little girl with you, right?

23:02.830 --> 23:05.420
While you were negotiating
with Zhang Ruipu,

23:06.740 --> 23:07.820
my people

23:08.570 --> 23:09.980
swapped her out.

23:53.940 --> 23:55.560
That friend of yours

23:55.920 --> 23:57.070
is pretty smart.

23:57.530 --> 23:59.400
I still can't figure out

24:00.140 --> 24:01.610
how he learned

24:01.700 --> 24:03.400
that Zhang Ruipu and we were

24:04.010 --> 24:05.770
not on the same side.

24:07.500 --> 24:08.850
You have no idea

24:09.980 --> 24:12.750
how much effort I put into the plan

24:14.250 --> 24:16.350
to assassinate Zhang Ruipu...

24:17.790 --> 24:18.740
Yet it was almost

24:19.660 --> 24:21.660
ruined by a cripple.

24:30.380 --> 24:31.780
His name is Zhang Haixia.

24:32.190 --> 24:33.520
Keep that in mind.

24:35.590 --> 24:36.380
Speak!

24:42.980 --> 24:44.440
Fortunately,

24:45.590 --> 24:46.950
Zhang Ruipu

24:47.420 --> 24:49.550
was defeated by his own arrogance.

24:50.240 --> 24:52.110
He underestimated his enemy.

24:52.840 --> 24:53.850
Then,

24:54.240 --> 24:56.110
I started hunting him down.

25:01.530 --> 25:03.880
I found he boarded the Nan'an.

25:06.920 --> 25:09.720
The poison was
taking a heavy toll on him back then.

25:10.680 --> 25:12.150
We all thought

25:13.000 --> 25:14.480
he was done for.

25:14.720 --> 25:15.920
But we never thought

25:16.770 --> 25:19.120
that he injured our men

25:20.030 --> 25:22.160
and escaped to the third-class cabin.

25:22.720 --> 25:24.210
Your friend is

25:24.570 --> 25:25.850
really something.

25:26.770 --> 25:28.090
Even with broken legs,

25:28.880 --> 25:30.600
he still cornered me

25:31.220 --> 25:32.960
this far.

25:34.570 --> 25:35.480
His death is

25:36.570 --> 25:37.960
such a pity.

25:50.220 --> 25:52.620
Is the one disguised
as Zhang Haijiao dead?

25:53.160 --> 25:55.100
You guys once

25:56.500 --> 25:58.280
met in the third-class cabin.

25:58.660 --> 26:01.720
If you haven't found her corpse,

26:01.940 --> 26:03.140
it proves that

26:03.640 --> 26:05.200
she has escaped.

26:05.880 --> 26:07.510
Do you remember
that assassin named Bai Zhu?

26:07.510 --> 26:09.050
A musketeer wanted
to torture her to death.

26:09.050 --> 26:10.310
Sir, you're mistaken.

26:10.330 --> 26:12.060
Do you know you're going to die?

26:23.640 --> 26:25.020
One last question.

26:27.750 --> 26:29.060
Who sent you?

26:30.810 --> 26:33.340
Why did you kill the people
from the Archives?

26:38.500 --> 26:40.000
Was it a warlord?

26:41.240 --> 26:42.510
I don't know.

26:44.070 --> 26:45.760
I was ordered

26:46.160 --> 26:48.470
to spread the Twilight Grass,

26:48.740 --> 26:51.400
bring all the people
from the Southern Archives

26:52.980 --> 26:54.890
to the Nan'an,

26:55.480 --> 26:58.140
and kill them all.

26:58.480 --> 26:59.480
I really

27:01.240 --> 27:02.850
don't know anything else.

27:23.000 --> 27:27.490
[The Nan'an]

27:39.510 --> 27:40.010
You...

27:41.240 --> 27:42.380
Where have you been?

27:42.400 --> 27:44.130
Why are you in such a mess again?

27:44.700 --> 27:45.510
Are you okay?

27:48.960 --> 27:50.720
Miss Dong repeatedly warned us

27:51.270 --> 27:53.180
not to leave this room.

28:16.760 --> 28:17.960
Eat as much as you can.

28:40.780 --> 28:42.380
I've known him my whole life.

28:46.450 --> 28:49.250
He used to complain
that I always acted recklessly

28:49.430 --> 28:51.490
without considering consequences,

28:51.750 --> 28:53.010
saying that I would die

28:53.900 --> 28:54.830
sooner or later.

29:00.410 --> 29:01.540
I never expected him

29:04.430 --> 29:05.490
to die first.

29:10.450 --> 29:11.060
Fine.

29:34.330 --> 29:35.140
Oh, shit!

29:36.400 --> 29:37.530
This is not over yet.

29:37.780 --> 29:39.710
Those who excavated the shipwreck

29:39.760 --> 29:41.960
to look for the Twilight Grass back then

29:42.790 --> 29:44.190
were the warlord forces.

29:44.800 --> 29:47.010
The Evil God is also
related to the warlords.

29:47.010 --> 29:48.150
The Twilight Grass and the Evil God

29:48.110 --> 29:49.080
[Mysterious Poison Is
Proliferating Rapidly]

29:48.170 --> 29:49.640
are wreaking havoc in Nanyang again now.

29:49.110 --> 29:50.300
[Causing Multiple Deaths in Xucheng]

29:50.440 --> 29:52.050
And right here on the Nan'an,

29:52.110 --> 29:54.000
[N P]

29:52.260 --> 29:53.510
someone's been hunting down

29:53.510 --> 29:56.510
the Archives agents
investigating the Twilight Grass.

29:56.510 --> 29:58.500
As for what the warlords
in the Panhua Reef Case

29:58.500 --> 30:00.430
want to do with the Twilight Grass,

30:00.560 --> 30:02.090
there is no conclusion yet.

30:02.230 --> 30:03.600
Panhua Reef?

30:04.680 --> 30:06.560
I... I think I've heard of it.

30:06.660 --> 30:08.700
Is it that haunted place?

30:12.060 --> 30:13.050
Eat more.

30:13.170 --> 30:14.770
Here, eat more if you can.

30:14.880 --> 30:16.010
Have this, too.

30:22.380 --> 30:23.110
Shrimpie,

30:25.960 --> 30:27.620
you wouldn't die for nothing.

30:29.750 --> 30:31.860
I will find out the forces behind this

30:34.000 --> 30:34.860
and avenge you.

30:36.850 --> 30:38.240
Attention, please.

30:38.830 --> 30:42.360
This voyage is about to reach
the final destination, Xiacheng.

30:42.750 --> 30:48.630
[The Nan'an]

30:42.980 --> 30:44.380
Attention, please.

30:44.420 --> 30:48.770
This voyage is about to reach
the final destination, Xiacheng.

30:50.510 --> 30:52.290
After over a decade,

30:52.750 --> 30:54.590
Zhang Hailou finally came home.

30:55.220 --> 30:58.410
[Xiacheng]

30:56.460 --> 30:57.310
This is also

30:58.240 --> 30:58.960
where everything

30:58.410 --> 31:00.670
[Xiacheng Pier]

30:58.960 --> 31:00.560
about the Southern Archives

31:01.660 --> 31:03.000
began.

31:25.850 --> 31:27.910
I'll hand this over to the ship police

31:27.940 --> 31:29.470
after getting off the ship.

31:38.250 --> 31:38.880
Plague,

31:39.680 --> 31:40.740
we're in Xiacheng.

31:40.750 --> 31:41.720
Let's get off.

31:47.860 --> 31:48.460
Plague...

31:51.940 --> 31:52.590
Plague?

31:56.970 --> 31:57.690
Plague?

32:02.240 --> 32:03.800
Why are you still here?

32:03.870 --> 32:05.540
It's safe.

32:05.810 --> 32:06.610
Relax.

32:06.610 --> 32:09.410
I hear there are
some beautiful girls in Xiacheng.

32:09.560 --> 32:10.460
He doesn't know, huh?

32:10.460 --> 32:11.240
I guess so.

32:26.040 --> 32:27.020
Miss Dong.

32:28.740 --> 32:29.650
The ship is about to dock.

32:29.650 --> 32:31.650
You were unwilling to see me before.

32:32.810 --> 32:34.410
May I ask you a few questions?

32:39.000 --> 32:39.840
Miss Dong?

33:30.190 --> 33:30.930
Miss Dong,

33:31.500 --> 33:33.410
the captured robbers have

33:33.590 --> 33:34.720
been attacked.

33:34.720 --> 33:35.420
Should we lock down the ship

33:35.420 --> 33:36.660
and find out who it was?

33:36.660 --> 33:37.350
No.

33:37.850 --> 33:39.750
Stick to the original plan.

33:41.310 --> 33:43.040
Whether alive or dead,

33:43.240 --> 33:45.160
hand them over to the ship police.

33:45.700 --> 33:46.400
Got it.

34:11.239 --> 34:12.330
Times are hard.

34:12.440 --> 34:13.639
Let's part ways here.

34:14.050 --> 34:15.480
If your obsession persists

34:15.480 --> 34:17.080
and you are still perplexed,

34:17.650 --> 34:19.179
you may come here for a chat.

34:19.590 --> 34:20.389
But remember,

34:20.520 --> 34:21.870
it's best we don't meet.

34:22.020 --> 34:23.750
There's nothing to say anyway.

36:12.190 --> 36:13.040
We're home,

36:14.170 --> 36:14.960
Haixia.

37:04.880 --> 37:07.830
[Welcome]

37:25.230 --> 37:25.880
Shrimpie,

37:27.050 --> 37:28.380
we are back in Xiacheng.

37:30.010 --> 37:33.220
[Xiacheng Pier]

37:33.600 --> 37:34.930
We've finally arrived.

37:35.240 --> 37:36.670
Yeah, I'm exhausted.
